{"assessment":{"format":"region-provider-state-assessment-v1", "record_id":"31b997b2a5208ab120fa483778bca9f1ec270c994b7937b3e5dd765db2bfabcd", "request_digest":"1a691388478370add9bae4e920fb1071369efa543057403727b422e9000a3d36", "raw_sha256":"500863d65c7f9ca69a66b2ffef3ef8a42b7033903cf1b5a5bd774d9f0decd87f", "outcome_code":"VALIDATION_MALFORMED_SCHEMA", "structured_sha256":"7031179aa4267fdc12a50a429eef184e4ecfb2efb3ae993b6a5527ecf9f4c476", "exact_structured_state":{"blocks":[{"literal_text":"Agreed. That is now your programme decision: reopen the Reasoning Protocol\nprogramme as ACTIVE and take the Family F alternative-model path, initially only to its\nown Planning Review.", "page_number":1, "provider_returned_ordinal":1, "source_region_id":"bb16752357a487e70765b1cfd650b5f26db9a8958fc78b36238dac76c2f59b97", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":72, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":72}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":160, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":160}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":48, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":42}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":130, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":99}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"The important bit is sequencing. We should not collapse your four decisions into one giant\nauthorisation document. Parker’s existing governance deliberately requires the decision to\nreopen to remain separate from the later decision to run Qwen.", "page_number":1, "provider_returned_ordinal":2, "source_region_id":"89e890b37bec0a16404d0f065c9d5e4e3b57538a702712ba73dd2776d431b124", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":88, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":88}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":175, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":175}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"The authorised direction", "page_number":1, "provider_returned_ordinal":3, "source_region_id":"f7c410f05706878e43d0399d2d75345fb4b7b7f6a2e3c7f7c91a6ac7bee25712", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":24, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":0}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":24, "kind":"ENLARGED_TEXT", "start_code_point":0}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"The governance chain should now be:", "page_number":1, "provider_returned_ordinal":4, "source_region_id":"c5ff1a3fd87b0996a49487985e0dfa5a6269d5cddd861d9e71e7bb0bf8b4427e", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"Reasoning Protocol programme\n        |\n        | currently PAUSED\n        ▼\n1. REOPENING DECISION\n        |\n        ├─ PROGRAMME_STATUS = ACTIVE\n        |\n        ├─ REOPENING_TRIGGER = SATISFIED\n        |\n        ├─ AUTHORISED_PATH = FAMILY F\n        |\n        └─ FAMILY F authorised to:\n            PLANNING REVIEW ONLY\n        |\n        | NO model run\n        | NO implementation\n        ▼\n2. FAMILY F PLANNING REVIEW\n        |\n        | Question:\n        | Does qwen2.5-coder:7b on the existing\n        | Parker server warrant governed diagnostic\n        | evaluation against the known failures?\n        ▼\n3. FAMILY F DIAGNOSTIC GOVERNANCE\n        |\n        ├─ minimum necessary Scope Lock\n        ├─ diagnostic/evidence plan\n        ├─ readiness verification\n        └─ explicit execution approval\n        ▼\n4. SERVER DIAGNOSTIC\n        |\n        └─ qwen2.5-coder:7b through Ollama\n        ▼\n5. EVIDENCE REVIEW", "page_number":1, "provider_returned_ordinal":5, "source_region_id":"e4c3079b9cf2d7b5504f45c9150156db689920e45ed74d8c049347ee25657278", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":28, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":28}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":38, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":38}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":65, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":65}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":75, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":75}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":97, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":97}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":107, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":107}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":145, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":145}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":155, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":155}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":196, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":196}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":206, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":206}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":242, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":242}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":252, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":252}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":288, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":288}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":321, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":321}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":331, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":331}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":353, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":353}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":381, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":381}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":391, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":391}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":419, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":419}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":429, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":429}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":449, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":449}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":498, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":498}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":549, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":549}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":596, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":596}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":606, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":606}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":639, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":639}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":649, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":649}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":689, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":689}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":727, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":727}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":761, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":761}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":800, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":800}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":810, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":810}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":831, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":831}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":841, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":841}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":887, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":887}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":897, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":897}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"That respects the existing Reopening Assessment, which expressly says an ACTIVE\ndecision may nominate one already-classified path to proceed to its separate\nPlanning Review only. It cannot itself select a remedy, authorise a model call, or create\nthe Scope Lock.", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":6, "source_region_id":"abfcdae2bc50821705e749471b3ab4e7ab7cb4599cc14ec76f377414e759f0d1", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":75, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":75}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":147, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":147}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":229, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":229}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":143, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":97}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":168, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":148}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"There is another distinction worth freezing now: we are not switching Parker from Llama\nto Qwen. We are not declaring Qwen better. We are not qualifying Qwen. And we are\ncertainly not quietly changing production while nobody is looking.", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":7, "source_region_id":"156de26c64bd1b6a312183fe3f71fff7184d1c1e52c61bce2230d8bf1d6dc22b", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":84, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":84}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":161, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":161}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":84, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":48}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":92, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":85}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"The initial proposition is simply:", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":8, "source_region_id":"46ee798d7f995bae204f733306dd56d27e8fccc36b54ec07e682e09747b6e95e", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"Determine whether qwen2.5-coder:7b, in Parker’s existing server environment,\nwarrants governed diagnostic evaluation as a Family F alternative-model\ncandidate against the known Reasoning Protocol failure surface.", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":9, "source_region_id":"5dfb6c252dd668e7ae9dc1be95c8243c4505916e825ca143a0b02e543a9ab668", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":75, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":75}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":143, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":143}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":208, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":0}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"And when we eventually reach the server diagnostic, its results remain a separate Family\nF evidence stream. They are not retrospectively mixed with the llama3.2:3b\nControl/Family A/B/C campaign. The accepted assessment specifically requires that sort of\nprovenance separation.", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":10, "source_region_id":"cf81d18a202dd3bee964c95501225016b311021585c8d27f0bf062a30c7faf15", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":85, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":85}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":157, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":157}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":242, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":242}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":103, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":73}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"One change to your step 3", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":11, "source_region_id":"805468eb8f52a0a5349bc580144d887ba142a1a5d637fab48a08e0141cccd43d", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":25, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":0}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":25, "kind":"ENLARGED_TEXT", "start_code_point":0}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"I would phrase it slightly more carefully than “minimum Scope Lock / execution approval.”", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":12, "source_region_id":"be7808563b11e71ef7963393b8cb7ffadbc93cb29e07562d8aba429b0ca47aee", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"We should let the Family F Planning Review determine what minimum governance is\nactually required rather than deciding its answer in advance. The repository already says\nFamily F requires fresh governance, but the Planning Review should establish the precise\ndiagnostic tier, fixtures, evidence requirements and approvals.", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":13, "source_region_id":"78fcff1e96bcb15bde58d43d44575cb072ed04f97bf837e674fe63546658f2a2", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":76, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":76}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":160, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":160}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":239, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":239}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":76, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":18}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":94, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":77}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"That prevents us from writing the Planning Review with the conclusion conveniently\nstuffed in its pocket.", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":14, "source_region_id":"868200fc49f52da1d9b7772c631cfaafa8f0cab62e71af170384d811ca37df4a", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":78, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":78}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"What we do next", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":15, "source_region_id":"0d1c3c2aa29c5d62aef4d111a828d1297040ca21fc32445a933b9f098be39a0f", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":15, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":0}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":15, "kind":"ENLARGED_TEXT", "start_code_point":0}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"Only Step 1 now.", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":16, "source_region_id":"cc46b28224aaa6a4bd2f6fb8d49085036f357e7bc7580ea105606541e6dc70a7", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":16, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":0}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"Author the standalone:", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":17, "source_region_id":"590e3b57d14cd8a11ef8af055559d0be393160d7e1299c9b817d78c01cba09b8", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"REASONING_PROTOCOL_LIVE_MODEL_CONFORMANCE_REOPENING_DECISION.md", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":18, "source_region_id":"e7ac0348a8ddbfe8d5858b0ba1eb82aff336dc38892813db432e6ed8e384dfc4", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"Its operative determination should ultimately be:", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":19, "source_region_id":"fedb44f6c3630c43307598e0249ed2ed125667800fc309cf4d33303299a20ebb", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"REOPENING_TRIGGER=SATISFIED\nPROGRAMME_STATUS=ACTIVE", "page_number":2, "provider_returned_ordinal":20, "source_region_id":"84be5cd59aa845e23a288b5a0a781b9620fa67e9609e5d5a5d9839096874a563", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":28, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":28}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"AUTHORIZED_PATH=FAMILY_F_ALTERNATIVE_MODEL\n\nFAMILY_F_CURRENT_AUTHORITY=\nPROCEED TO A DEDICATED PLANNING REVIEW ONLY\n\nREMEDY_SELECTED=NO\nMODEL_SELECTED=NO\nMODEL_QUALIFIED=NO\n\nIMPLEMENTATION_AUTHORIZED=NO\nMODEL_RUN_AUTHORIZED=NO\nCAMPAIGN_AUTHORIZED=NO\n\nQWEN_2_5_CODER_7B_RUN_AUTHORIZED=NO\n\nKNOWLEDGE_DISCOVERABILITY_ATTEMPT_3_AUTHORIZED=NO\n\nNEXT_LAWFUL_ACTION=\nFAMILY F ALTERNATIVE-MODEL DIAGNOSTIC PLANNING REVIEW", "page_number":3, "provider_returned_ordinal":21, "source_region_id":"e2c2d8fe0e894fd2b42f53f75c4c7d1304755db1486a29877c01265a6b3e84ff", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":42, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":42}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":43, "kind":"PARAGRAPH_BREAK", "start_code_point":42}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":71, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":71}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":115, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":115}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":116, "kind":"PARAGRAPH_BREAK", "start_code_point":115}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":135, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":135}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":153, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":153}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":172, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":172}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":173, "kind":"PARAGRAPH_BREAK", "start_code_point":172}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":202, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":202}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":226, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":226}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":249, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":249}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":250, "kind":"PARAGRAPH_BREAK", "start_code_point":249}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":284, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":284}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":285, "kind":"PARAGRAPH_BREAK", "start_code_point":284}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":334, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":334}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":335, "kind":"PARAGRAPH_BREAK", "start_code_point":334}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":354, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":354}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"Once that document has been independently constitutionally reviewed, committed and\nmerged, then we author Step 2.", "page_number":3, "provider_returned_ordinal":22, "source_region_id":"b78c8e9db83b018303137291c264750d7d915befb8ccc0c2348b02b1067f77c2", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":77, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":77}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":111, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":85}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"That gives you exactly the direction you’ve chosen while preserving Parker’s governance\nchain.", "page_number":3, "provider_returned_ordinal":23, "source_region_id":"29e27784f702b78f15da39de43ca36a00a884dd7482b454ba3b81006d8c78e13", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":82, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":82}], "warnings":[]}, {"literal_text":"And importantly, tonight we do not touch the running Parker server or Qwen yet. The\nnext operation is repository governance only.", "page_number":3, "provider_returned_ordinal":24, "source_region_id":"cf9708d64b9225de5c534717d564c485f0108f8a8d1a8585c5ff9636aa415fec", "status":"TRANSCRIBED", "uncertainties":[], "visual_observations":[{"end_code_point_exclusive":79, "kind":"LINE_BREAK", "start_code_point":79}, {"end_code_point_exclusive":79, "kind":"BOLD", "start_code_point":29}], "warnings":[]}], "correlation_id":"correlation-fa-9-4p-a1e-r6-8c1", "provider_provenance":{"adapter_id":"openai-api-adapter", "adapter_version":"1.0", "parser_id":"region-anchored-transcription-parser", "parser_version":"1.0", "provider":"OpenAI", "provider_reported_model":null, "provider_response_id":null, "requested_model":"unknown"}, "schema_id":"region-anchored-transcription-schema-v1", "schema_version":4, "transcription_profile_id":"region-anchored-fidelity-acquisition-v1"}}, "assessment_sha256":"39fbc01c7cf831ebf5fc0751cfcca73310bc1a1a1846508ff46d64c61bd09da7"}